### Key Features

- **No tagline** (removed for cleaner appearance)
- **No "More Info" button** (clicking anywhere navigates to details)
- **Year, runtime, genres** on same row as action buttons
- **5 ratings** shown (TMDB, IMDb, RT Critic, RT Audience, Google)
- **4 cast members** in 2x2 grid with photos and character names
- **Watch providers** with click-through to streaming service
- **Badges** shown using `getHoverCardBadges()` (Trending, New, etc.)

### HoverCardWrapper Props

```typescript
interface HoverCardWrapperProps {
  children: ReactNode;
  item: MovieListItem | SeriesListItem;
